// news_digest.proto — the daily Claude news digest overlay: one large panel,
// drawn over the feed in EVERY webview at once, until any one of them
// dismisses it (which takes it down in all of them).
//
// THE DAEMON WRITES THE DIGEST. Once a day it reads its watched sources
// (Anthropic's news page, the docs and support release notes, the model
// deprecation page, the Claude Code and Agent SDK release feeds and
// changelog, the Agent SDK's npm releases, and the status history), keeps
// only what is new since the last digest, and has a model condense it into
// the sections below. The webview draws the view verbatim and derives
// nothing; every element is a resolved value.
//
//   ┌─ NewsDigestOverlay ─────────────────────────────────────┐
//   │ ┌ NewsDigestHeader ───────────────────────────────────┐ │
//   │ │ [NewsDigestTitle]           [NewsDigestPeriod]  [×] │ │
//   │ └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │
//   │ ┌ NewsDigestSection (affects the agent-repl backend) ─┐ │
//   │ │ [NewsDigestSectionHeading]                          │ │
//   │ │ ┌ NewsDigestItem ─────────────────────────────────┐ │ │
//   │ │ │ [title]                                [impact] │ │ │
//   │ │ │ [summary]                                       │ │ │
//   │ │ │ [link] [link]                                   │ │ │
//   │ │ └─────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │ │
//   │ └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │
//   │ … one section per kind that has items …                 │
//   │ ┌ NewsDigestSources ──────────────────────────────────┐ │
//   │ │ source · checked / failed                           │ │
//   │ └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │
//   └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘

